{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794801372487,"sessionID":"ses_e1d814441ffe6QmxiENmg3wjTp","part":{"partID":"prt_1e27f8beb001n7vQmKbxbul3rd","sessionID":"ses_e1d814441ffe6QmxiENmg3wjTp","messageID":"msg_1e27f83a5001iQ0vm1rE5hgZMx","type":"tool","id":"call_1b6eb0d4095d44d28d0b6621","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"limit":250,"offset":1120,"path":".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml"},"output":"Read file .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml, lines 1120-1369\n1120: \n1121:               step_resolve_divergent_pivot_result:\n1122:                 action: \"Use prepare's terminal result on resume/short-circuit, otherwise use finalize's result\"\n1123:                 branch_on: \"pivot_prepare_status\"\n1124:                 if_pending: { bind: { pivot_result: \"{pivot_finalize_json}\" } }\n1125:                 if_completed_or_failed: { bind: { pivot_result: \"{pivot_prepare_json}\" } }\n1126: \n1127:               step_apply_divergent_pivot_result:\n1128:                 action: \"Adopt a successful focus or fail closed to the existing synthesis path\"\n1129:                 branch_on: \"pivot_result.status\"\n1130:                 if_completed:\n1131:                   gate_divergent_pivot_choice:\n1132:                     applies_to: confirm\n1133:                     type: approval_gate\n1134:                     purpose: \"Approve the Council-selected research direction before it becomes the next focus\"\n1135:                     order: \"Under confirm this gate runs before the set, command, log and proceed_to of this branch.\"\n1136:                     present: |\n1137:                       ## Divergent Pivot Candidate\n1138: \n1139:                       **Pivot**: {pivot_result.pivotId}\n1140:                       **Council-selected candidate**: {pivot_result.selectedCandidate.id}\n1141:                       **Focus**: {pivot_result.restoredFocus}\n1142:                       **Agreement**: {pivot_result.agreement.endorsementCount}/3 material endorsements\n1143:                       **Saturated direction**: {pivot_result.completedEvent.previousFocus}\n1144: \n1145:                       The Phase 2 adapter exposes an ordered candidate frontier and agreement tallies, but no ranked-candidate score contract. Choosing a different ranked candidate is therefore unavailable in this phase rather than inferred from array order.\n1146: \n1147:                       Options:\n1148:                       A) Accept the Council-selected candidate and continue\n1149:                       B) Choose a different ranked candidate (unavailable: no ranking contract)\n1150:                       C) manualStop and proceed to the existing pre-synthesis gate\n1151:                     wait_for: \"User response\"\n1152:                     after_gate_refresh_lock: gate_defaults.after_gate_refresh_lock\n1153:                     on_A:\n1154:                       bookkeeping_log: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"pivot_confirm_accepted\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"run\":{current_iteration},\"pivotId\":\"{pivot_result.pivotId}\",\"selectedCandidate\":{pivot_result.selectedCandidate},\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\",\"sessionId\":\"{config.lineage.sessionId}\",\"generation\":{config.lineage.generation}}'\n1155:                       continue: \"Run the set, command, log and proceed_to of this branch.\"\n1156:                     on_B:\n1157:                       message: \"No ranked alternative can be selected because the adapter exposes no ranking score or rank contract.\"\n1158:                       return_to: gate_divergent_pivot_choice\n1159:                     on_C:\n1160:                       bookkeeping_log: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"manualStop\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"run\":{current_iteration},\"stopReason\":\"manualStop\",\"pivotId\":\"{pivot_result.pivotId}\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\",\"sessionId\":\"{config.lineage.sessionId}\",\"generation\":{config.lineage.generation}}'\n1161:                       set: { reason: \"manualStop\" }\n1162:                       skip_to: gate_pre_synthesis\n1163:                   set:\n1164:                     next_focus: \"{pivot_result.restoredFocus}\"\n1165:                     pivot_lineage: \"Pivot {pivot_result.pivotId} selected {pivot_result.selectedCandidate.id} from source iteration {current_iteration}.\"\n1166:                     saturated_directions: \"{pivot_result.completedEvent.saturatedDirections}\"\n1167:                   command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} {reducer_artifact_arg}\"\n1168:                   log: \"Divergent pivot {pivot_result.pivotId} restored focus to {pivot_result.restoredFocus}; continuing iteration {current_iteration}.\"\n1169:                   proceed_to: step_rejected_pattern_cache\n1170:                 if_failed:\n1171:                   gate_divergent_pivot_override:\n1172:                     applies_to: confirm\n1173:                     type: approval_gate\n1174:                     purpose: \"Offer the audited operator override when a failed pivot is recoverable\"\n1175:                     condition: \"Runs only when pivot_result.failedEvent.recoverableByOverride == true AND pivot_result.agreement.reason == 'insufficient_endorsement'. Otherwise this gate is skipped and the branch fails closed as written.\"\n1176:                     order: \"Under confirm this gate runs before the log and skip_to of this branch.\"\n1177:                     present: |\n1178:                       ## Divergent Pivot Did Not Converge\n1179: \n1180:                       **Pivot**: {pivot_result.pivotId}\n1181:                       **Failure**: {pivot_result.failureReason}\n1182:                       **Agreement tallies**: {pivot_result.agreement.tallies}\n1183: \n1184:                       The adapter marked this insufficient-endorsement failure as recoverable by explicit operator override. The candidate frontier is unranked; any override must name an accepted candidate id and provide a rationale.\n1185: \n1186:                       Options:\n1187:                       A) Fail closed to synthesis\n1188:                       B) Explicitly override with accepted candidate id + rationale\n1189:                       C) manualStop and proceed to the existing pre-synthesis gate\n1190:                     wait_for: \"User response\"\n1191:                     after_gate_refresh_lock: gate_defaults.after_gate_refresh_lock\n1192:                     on_A: { continue: \"Fail closed: run the log and skip_to of this branch.\" }\n1193:                     on_B:\n1194:                       action: \"Read pivot_result.paths.configPath, validate the supplied id against acceptedCandidates, bind the exact candidate and persisted previousFocus/saturatedDirections/frontier, and reject ids outside that frontier.\"\n1195:                       append_jsonl: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"pivot_override_accepted\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"run\":{current_iteration},\"pivotId\":\"{pivot_result.pivotId}\",\"selectedCandidate\":{operator_selected_candidate},\"selectedFrontier\":{operator_selected_frontier},\"previousFocus\":\"{operator_previous_focus}\",\"saturatedDirections\":{operator_saturated_directions},\"reason\":\"{operator_override_rationale}\",\"agreementReason\":\"insufficient_endorsement\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\",\"sessionId\":\"{config.lineage.sessionId}\",\"generation\":{config.lineage.generation}}'\n1196:                       set:\n1197:                         next_focus: \"{operator_selected_candidate.focus}\"\n1198:                         pivot_lineage: \"Pivot {pivot_result.pivotId} used an audited insufficient-endorsement override for {operator_selected_candidate.id}.\"\n1199:                         saturated_directions: \"{operator_saturated_directions}\"\n1200:                       command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} {reducer_artifact_arg}\"\n1201:                       proceed_to: step_rejected_pattern_cache\n1202:                     on_C:\n1203:                       bookkeeping_log: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"manualStop\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"run\":{current_iteration},\"stopReason\":\"manualStop\",\"pivotId\":\"{pivot_result.pivotId}\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\",\"sessionId\":\"{config.lineage.sessionId}\",\"generation\":{config.lineage.generation}}'\n1204:                       set: { reason: \"manualStop\" }\n1205:                       skip_to: gate_pre_synthesis\n1206:                   log: \"Divergent pivot {pivot_result.pivotId} failed closed ({pivot_result.failureReason}); proceeding to synthesis.\"\n1207:                   skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1208:             on_error:\n1209:               log: \"Divergent pivot integration error; failing closed to the existing synthesis path.\"\n1210:               skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1211:           if_existing_terminal_path:\n1212:             log: \"Loop stopping. Reason: {reason}\"\n1213:             skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1214:         if_stuck_recovery:\n1215:           dry_run_event_policy: preview-only\n1216:           append_jsonl: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"stuckRecovery\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"run\":{current_iteration},\"stopReason\":\"stuckRecovery\",\"fromIteration\":{current_iteration},\"outcome\":\"recovered\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\",\"sessionId\":\"{config.lineage.sessionId}\",\"generation\":{config.lineage.generation}}'\n1217:           log: \"Stuck detected ({stuck_count} consecutive no-progress). Entering recovery.\"\n1218:           set: { next_focus: \"RECOVERY: Widen scope. Try fundamentally different approach. Least-explored question: {least_explored}\" }\n1219:         if_continue:\n1220:           log: \"Iteration {current_iteration}: Continuing. Focus: {next_focus}\"\n1221: \n1222:       step_rejected_pattern_cache:\n1223:         action: \"Apply reducer-derived rejected-pattern suppression before dispatch candidate selection\"\n1224:         read:\n1225:           - \"{state_paths.state_log}\"\n1226:           - \"{state_paths.registry}\"\n1227:           - \"{state_paths.strategy}\"\n1228:         candidate_sources:\n1229:           next_focus:\n1230:             category: \"next-focus\"\n1231:             values:\n1232:               - \"{next_focus}\"\n1233:               - \"{remaining_questions_list}\"\n1234:               - \"{carried_forward_open_questions}\"\n1235:           recovery:\n1236:             category: \"recovery\"\n1237:             values:\n1238:               - \"{recovery_strategy}\"\n1239:               - \"{least_explored}\"\n1240:           ideas:\n1241:             category: \"ideas\"\n1242:             values:\n1243:               - \"{promoted_ideas_list}\"\n1244:             optional_file: \"{state_paths.packet_dir}/research-ideas.md\"\n1245:         algorithm: |\n1246:           Use registry.rejectedPatternIndex and registry.promotedIdeas from the latest\n1247:           reducer pass as the source of truth.\n1248:           Compare normalized exact text first. Then compare fuzzy similarity with\n1249:           rejected_pattern_fuzzy_threshold, but only when candidate and rejected categories\n1250:           are compatible. Remove suppressed candidates from next_focus, recovery, and ideas\n1251:           selection before rendering the dispatch prompt. If all candidates are suppressed,\n1252:           halt for operator input instead of reusing a rejected idea.\n1253:         outputs:\n1254:           - accepted_next_focus: \"First unsuppressed next-focus candidate, or null\"\n1255:           - accepted_recovery_candidate: \"First unsuppressed recovery candidate, or null\"\n1256:           - accepted_idea_candidate: \"First unsuppressed ideas candidate, or null\"\n1257:           - rejected_candidate_matches: \"Suppressed candidate diagnostics from registry.suppressedCandidates plus any current-step matches\"\n1258:         if_next_focus_suppressed:\n1259:           set: { next_focus: \"{accepted_next_focus || accepted_recovery_candidate || accepted_idea_candidate}\" }\n1260:           log: \"Rejected-pattern cache suppressed the prior candidate; dispatching the next accepted candidate.\"\n1261:         if_all_candidates_suppressed:\n1262:           halt: true\n1263:           release_lock: step_release_lock\n1264:           message: 'All next-focus, recovery, and ideas candidates match active rejected patterns. Remove or reset the rejected pattern, or provide a new focus. In a ledger-backed run (a deep-research-ledger/frames folder beside the state log) the next projection replaces a hand-edited state log, so record the removal or reset through the append gateway: write one row to a file, either {\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"idea_rejected_removed\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"pattern\":\"<rejected text>\",\"category\":\"<its category>\",\"timestamp\":\"<UTC now, e.g. 2026-05-24T00:00:00Z>\"} or {\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"idea_rejected_reset\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"reason\":\"<why>\",\"timestamp\":\"<UTC now>\"}, then run node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mode research --run-directory {artifact_dir} --event-json <that file> and rerun the reducer before resuming.'\n1265: \n1266:       step_ideas_backlog_lifecycle:\n1267:         action: \"Track reducer-owned observed/promoted/rejected idea lifecycle before dispatch\"\n1268:         read:\n1269:           - \"{state_paths.state_log}\"\n1270:           - \"{state_paths.registry}\"\n1271:           - \"{state_paths.config}\"\n1272:         lifecycle:\n1273:           observed_event: \"idea_observed\"\n1274:           promoted_event: \"idea_promoted\"\n1275:           rejected_event: \"idea_rejected\"\n1276:           min_observations: \"{min_idea_observations}\"\n1277:           authority: \"Leaf agents emit observations only; reducer emits promotions and owns ranking.\"\n1278:         validate:\n1279:           - \"If new leaf-authored output includes idea_promoted, fail validation; only reducer output may append idea_promoted.\"\n1280:           - \"If promoted_ideas_count > 0 and next_focus is empty or all questions are resolved, prefer the first unsuppressed promoted idea.\"\n1281:           - \"If suppressed_ideas_count > 0, do not render those ideas into dispatch context.\"\n1282:         outputs:\n1283:           - observed_ideas_count: \"Reducer-derived observed ideas count\"\n1284:           - promoted_ideas_count: \"Reducer-derived promoted ideas count after minIdeaObservations\"\n1285:           - suppressed_ideas_count: \"Reducer-derived rejected/suppressed ideas count\"\n1286:           - accepted_idea_candidate: \"First unsuppressed promoted idea, or null\"\n1287: \n1288:       step_normalize_pause_events:\n1289:         action: \"Normalize pause and recovery lifecycle events to the frozen STOP_REASONS enum at emission time\"\n1290:         stop_reasons_enum: [converged, maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused, maxDurationReached]\n1291:         rule_pause_sentinel:\n1292:           raw_event_forbidden: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"paused\"}'\n1293:           canonical_event: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"userPaused\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"run\":{current_iteration},\"stopReason\":\"userPaused\",\"sentinelPath\":\"{state_paths.pause_sentinel}\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\",\"sessionId\":\"{config.lineage.sessionId}\",\"generation\":{config.lineage.generation}}'\n1294:         rule_stuck_recovery:\n1295:           raw_event_forbidden: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"stuck_recovery\"}'\n1296:           canonical_event: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"stuckRecovery\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"run\":{current_iteration},\"stopReason\":\"stuckRecovery\",\"fromIteration\":{current_iteration},\"outcome\":\"recovered\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\",\"sessionId\":\"{config.lineage.sessionId}\",\"generation\":{config.lineage.generation}}'\n1297: \n1298:       step_marker_scan:\n1299:         action: \"H-2 loop-prevention guard: scan previous iteration's rendered prompt for nested research marker\"\n1300:         canonical_header: \"DEEP-RESEARCH\"\n1301:         nested_marker_pattern: \"^(DEEP-REVIEW|CODE-REVIEW)$\"\n1302:         algorithm: |\n1303:           if current_iteration > 1:\n1304:             PREV_PROMPT_PATH = \"{state_paths.prompt_dir}/iteration-{previous_iteration}.md\"\n1305:             if file_exists(PREV_PROMPT_PATH):\n1306:               PREV_PROMPT_FIRST_LINE = head -1 of PREV_PROMPT_PATH\n1307:               if PREV_PROMPT_FIRST_LINE matches nested_marker_pattern:\n1308:                 log \"ERROR: nested research-of-review loop detected (review marker found in previous iteration prompt). Aborting.\"\n1309:                 halt with exit code 2\n1310:         note: |\n1311:           False-positive prevention: a research prompt that starts with its own canonical\n1312:           header is this loop's own iteration output, never a nested dispatch; only a review\n1313:           marker is, so the guard matches nested_marker_pattern rather than the canonical\n1314:           header. Markers appearing in comments or body text are ignored. True-positive\n1315:           triggers only when a previous iteration's rendered prompt literally starts with a\n1316:           review marker, indicating a nested research-of-review dispatch.\n1317: \n1318:       # ─── APPROVAL GATE: Pre-Iteration ───\n1319:       gate_pre_iteration:\n1320:         applies_to: confirm\n1321:         skip_when: \"The operator already approved the next dispatch in this pass through gate_consecutive_failures, gate_divergent_pivot_choice or gate_divergent_pivot_override.\"\n1322:         type: approval_gate\n1323:         purpose: \"Show planned focus and get approval before dispatching agent\"\n1324:         present: |\n1325:           ## Iteration {current_iteration} of {max_iterations}\n1326: \n1327:           **Focus**: {next_focus}\n1328:           **Remaining Questions**: {remaining_questions}\n1329:           **Last newInfoRatio**: {last_newInfoRatio}\n1330:           **Stuck Count**: {stuck_count}\n1331: \n1332:           Options:\n1333:           A) Proceed with this focus\n1334:           B) Change focus to: [user provides new focus]\n1335:           C) Stop loop and synthesize now\n1336:           D) Cancel entirely\n1337:         wait_for: \"User response\"\n1338:         after_gate_refresh_lock: gate_defaults.after_gate_refresh_lock\n1339:         on_A: { proceed_to: step_dispatch_iteration }\n1340:         on_B: { action: \"Update next_focus to user's choice\", proceed_to: step_dispatch_iteration }\n1341:         on_C:\n1342:           action: \"Record the operator-requested manual stop before synthesis\"\n1343:           bookkeeping_log: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"manualStop\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"run\":{current_iteration},\"stopReason\":\"manualStop\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\",\"sessionId\":\"{config.lineage.sessionId}\",\"generation\":{config.lineage.generation}}'\n1344:           set: { reason: \"manualStop\" }\n1345:           proceed_to: gate_pre_synthesis\n1346:         on_D: { action: \"Cancel workflow\", status: \"CANCELLED\", release_lock: step_release_lock }\n1347: \n1348:       step_dispatch_iteration:\n1349:         action: \"Dispatch one iteration via the selected executor\"\n1350:         pre_dispatch_refresh_lock:\n1351:           action: \"Refresh the packet lock heartbeat immediately before the dispatch starts\"\n1352:           command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/loop-lock.cjs refresh --lock-path {state_paths.lock_file} --owner-pid {captured_owner_pid} --nonce {captured_acquire_nonce}\"\n1353:           on_refresh: \"If the refresh output has refreshed:false, fail closed: lost the packet lock. Run step_release_lock and stop rather than dispatch without it.\"\n1354:         post_dispatch_refresh_lock:\n1355:           action: \"Refresh the packet lock heartbeat immediately after the dispatch returns\"\n1356:           command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/loop-lock.cjs refresh --lock-path {state_paths.lock_file} --owner-pid {captured_owner_pid} --nonce {captured_acquire_nonce}\"\n1357:           on_refresh: \"If the refresh output has refreshed:false, fail closed: lost the packet lock. Run step_release_lock and stop rather than continue without it.\"\n1358:         dry_run_boundary: \"dispatch\"\n1359:         dry_run_preview:\n1360:           before_halt:\n1361:             - \"Generate the state summary.\"\n1362:             - \"Render the prompt pack to terminal preview without writing the prompt file.\"\n1363:             - \"Show the selected executor branch and command or native dispatch target that would run.\"\n1364:         resolve_executor:\n1365:           source: \"config.executor\"\n1366:           loader: \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts#parseExecutorConfig\"\n1367:         pre_dispatch:\n1368:           generate_summary: |\n1369:             STATE SUMMARY (auto-generated):\n[Output truncated. Continue reading with offset: 1370]","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":true},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml, lines 1120-1369\n1120: \n1121:               step_resolve_divergent_pivot_result:\n1122:                 action: \"Use prepare's terminal result on resume/short-circuit, otherwise use finalize's result\"\n1123:                 branch_on: \"pivot_prepare_status\"\n1124:                 if_pending: { bind: { pivot_result: \"{pivot_finalize_json}\" } }\n1125:                 if_completed_or_failed: { bind: { pivot_result: \"{pivot_prepare_json}\" } }\n1126: \n1127:               step_apply_divergent_pivot_result:\n1128:                 action: \"Adopt a successful focus or fail closed to the existing synthesis path\"\n1129:                 branch_on: \"pivot_result.status\"\n1130:                 if_completed:\n1131:                   gate_divergent_pivot_choice:\n1132:                     applies_to: confirm\n1133:                     type: approval_gate\n1134:                     purpose: \"Approve the Council-selected research direction before it becomes the next focus\"\n1135:                     order: \"Under confirm this gate runs before the set, command, log and proceed_to of this branch.\"\n1136:                     present: |\n1137:                       ## Divergent Pivot Candidate\n1138: \n1139:                       **Pivot**: {pivot_result.pivotId}\n1140:                       **Council-selected candidate**: {pivot_result.selectedCandidate.id}\n1141:                       **Focus**: {pivot_result.restoredFocus}\n1142:                       **Agreement**: {pivot_result.agreement.endorsementCount}/3 material endorsements\n1143:                       **Saturated direction**: {pivot_result.completedEvent.previousFocus}\n1144: \n1145:                       The Phase 2 adapter exposes an ordered candidate frontier and agreement tallies, but no ranked-candidate score contract. Choosing a different ranked candidate is therefore unavailable in this phase rather than inferred from array order.\n1146: \n1147:                       Options:\n1148:                       A) Accept the Council-selected candidate and continue\n1149:                       B) Choose a different ranked candidate (unavailable: no ranking contract)\n1150:                       C) manualStop and proceed to the existing pre-synthesis gate\n1151:                     wait_for: \"User response\"\n1152:                     after_gate_refresh_lock: gate_defaults.after_gate_refresh_lock\n1153:                     on_A:\n1154:                       bookkeeping_log: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"pivot_confirm_accepted\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"run\":{current_iteration},\"pivotId\":\"{pivot_result.pivotId}\",\"selectedCandidate\":{pivot_result.selectedCandidate},\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\",\"sessionId\":\"{config.lineage.sessionId}\",\"generation\":{config.lineage.generation}}'\n1155:                       continue: \"Run the set, command, log and proceed_to of this branch.\"\n1156:                     on_B:\n1157:                       message: \"No ranked alternative can be selected because the adapter exposes no ranking score or rank contract.\"\n1158:                       return_to: gate_divergent_pivot_choice\n1159:                     on_C:\n1160:                       bookkeeping_log: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"manualStop\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"run\":{current_iteration},\"stopReason\":\"manualStop\",\"pivotId\":\"{pivot_result.pivotId}\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\",\"sessionId\":\"{config.lineage.sessionId}\",\"generation\":{config.lineage.generation}}'\n1161:                       set: { reason: \"manualStop\" }\n1162:                       skip_to: gate_pre_synthesis\n1163:                   set:\n1164:                     next_focus: \"{pivot_result.restoredFocus}\"\n1165:                     pivot_lineage: \"Pivot {pivot_result.pivotId} selected {pivot_result.selectedCandidate.id} from source iteration {current_iteration}.\"\n1166:                     saturated_directions: \"{pivot_result.completedEvent.saturatedDirections}\"\n1167:                   command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} {reducer_artifact_arg}\"\n1168:                   log: \"Divergent pivot {pivot_result.pivotId} restored focus to {pivot_result.restoredFocus}; continuing iteration {current_iteration}.\"\n1169:                   proceed_to: step_rejected_pattern_cache\n1170:                 if_failed:\n1171:                   gate_divergent_pivot_override:\n1172:                     applies_to: confirm\n1173:                     type: approval_gate\n1174:                     purpose: \"Offer the audited operator override when a failed pivot is recoverable\"\n1175:                     condition: \"Runs only when pivot_result.failedEvent.recoverableByOverride == true AND pivot_result.agreement.reason == 'insufficient_endorsement'. Otherwise this gate is skipped and the branch fails closed as written.\"\n1176:                     order: \"Under confirm this gate runs before the log and skip_to of this branch.\"\n1177:                     present: |\n1178:                       ## Divergent Pivot Did Not Converge\n1179: \n1180:                       **Pivot**: {pivot_result.pivotId}\n1181:                       **Failure**: {pivot_result.failureReason}\n1182:                       **Agreement tallies**: {pivot_result.agreement.tallies}\n1183: \n1184:                       The adapter marked this insufficient-endorsement failure as recoverable by explicit operator override. The candidate frontier is unranked; any override must name an accepted candidate id and provide a rationale.\n1185: \n1186:                       Options:\n1187:                       A) Fail closed to synthesis\n1188:                       B) Explicitly override with accepted candidate id + rationale\n1189:                       C) manualStop and proceed to the existing pre-synthesis gate\n1190:                     wait_for: \"User response\"\n1191:                     after_gate_refresh_lock: gate_defaults.after_gate_refresh_lock\n1192:                     on_A: { continue: \"Fail closed: run the log and skip_to of this branch.\" }\n1193:                     on_B:\n1194:                       action: \"Read pivot_result.paths.configPath, validate the supplied id against acceptedCandidates, bind the exact candidate and persisted previousFocus/saturatedDirections/frontier, and reject ids outside that frontier.\"\n1195:                       append_jsonl: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"pivot_override_accepted\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"run\":{current_iteration},\"pivotId\":\"{pivot_result.pivotId}\",\"selectedCandidate\":{operator_selected_candidate},\"selectedFrontier\":{operator_selected_frontier},\"previousFocus\":\"{operator_previous_focus}\",\"saturatedDirections\":{operator_saturated_directions},\"reason\":\"{operator_override_rationale}\",\"agreementReason\":\"insufficient_endorsement\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\",\"sessionId\":\"{config.lineage.sessionId}\",\"generation\":{config.lineage.generation}}'\n1196:                       set:\n1197:                         next_focus: \"{operator_selected_candidate.focus}\"\n1198:                         pivot_lineage: \"Pivot {pivot_result.pivotId} used an audited insufficient-endorsement override for {operator_selected_candidate.id}.\"\n1199:                         saturated_directions: \"{operator_saturated_directions}\"\n1200:                       command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} {reducer_artifact_arg}\"\n1201:                       proceed_to: step_rejected_pattern_cache\n1202:                     on_C:\n1203:                       bookkeeping_log: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"manualStop\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"run\":{current_iteration},\"stopReason\":\"manualStop\",\"pivotId\":\"{pivot_result.pivotId}\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\",\"sessionId\":\"{config.lineage.sessionId}\",\"generation\":{config.lineage.generation}}'\n1204:                       set: { reason: \"manualStop\" }\n1205:                       skip_to: gate_pre_synthesis\n1206:                   log: \"Divergent pivot {pivot_result.pivotId} failed closed ({pivot_result.failureReason}); proceeding to synthesis.\"\n1207:                   skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1208:             on_error:\n1209:               log: \"Divergent pivot integration error; failing closed to the existing synthesis path.\"\n1210:               skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1211:           if_existing_terminal_path:\n1212:             log: \"Loop stopping. Reason: {reason}\"\n1213:             skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1214:         if_stuck_recovery:\n1215:           dry_run_event_policy: preview-only\n1216:           append_jsonl: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"stuckRecovery\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"run\":{current_iteration},\"stopReason\":\"stuckRecovery\",\"fromIteration\":{current_iteration},\"outcome\":\"recovered\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\",\"sessionId\":\"{config.lineage.sessionId}\",\"generation\":{config.lineage.generation}}'\n1217:           log: \"Stuck detected ({stuck_count} consecutive no-progress). Entering recovery.\"\n1218:           set: { next_focus: \"RECOVERY: Widen scope. Try fundamentally different approach. Least-explored question: {least_explored}\" }\n1219:         if_continue:\n1220:           log: \"Iteration {current_iteration}: Continuing. Focus: {next_focus}\"\n1221: \n1222:       step_rejected_pattern_cache:\n1223:         action: \"Apply reducer-derived rejected-pattern suppression before dispatch candidate selection\"\n1224:         read:\n1225:           - \"{state_paths.state_log}\"\n1226:           - \"{state_paths.registry}\"\n1227:           - \"{state_paths.strategy}\"\n1228:         candidate_sources:\n1229:           next_focus:\n1230:             category: \"next-focus\"\n1231:             values:\n1232:               - \"{next_focus}\"\n1233:               - \"{remaining_questions_list}\"\n1234:               - \"{carried_forward_open_questions}\"\n1235:           recovery:\n1236:             category: \"recovery\"\n1237:             values:\n1238:               - \"{recovery_strategy}\"\n1239:               - \"{least_explored}\"\n1240:           ideas:\n1241:             category: \"ideas\"\n1242:             values:\n1243:               - \"{promoted_ideas_list}\"\n1244:             optional_file: \"{state_paths.packet_dir}/research-ideas.md\"\n1245:         algorithm: |\n1246:           Use registry.rejectedPatternIndex and registry.promotedIdeas from the latest\n1247:           reducer pass as the source of truth.\n1248:           Compare normalized exact text first. Then compare fuzzy similarity with\n1249:           rejected_pattern_fuzzy_threshold, but only when candidate and rejected categories\n1250:           are compatible. Remove suppressed candidates from next_focus, recovery, and ideas\n1251:           selection before rendering the dispatch prompt. If all candidates are suppressed,\n1252:           halt for operator input instead of reusing a rejected idea.\n1253:         outputs:\n1254:           - accepted_next_focus: \"First unsuppressed next-focus candidate, or null\"\n1255:           - accepted_recovery_candidate: \"First unsuppressed recovery candidate, or null\"\n1256:           - accepted_idea_candidate: \"First unsuppressed ideas candidate, or null\"\n1257:           - rejected_candidate_matches: \"Suppressed candidate diagnostics from registry.suppressedCandidates plus any current-step matches\"\n1258:         if_next_focus_suppressed:\n1259:           set: { next_focus: \"{accepted_next_focus || accepted_recovery_candidate || accepted_idea_candidate}\" }\n1260:           log: \"Rejected-pattern cache suppressed the prior candidate; dispatching the next accepted candidate.\"\n1261:         if_all_candidates_suppressed:\n1262:           halt: true\n1263:           release_lock: step_release_lock\n1264:           message: 'All next-focus, recovery, and ideas candidates match active rejected patterns. Remove or reset the rejected pattern, or provide a new focus. In a ledger-backed run (a deep-research-ledger/frames folder beside the state log) the next projection replaces a hand-edited state log, so record the removal or reset through the append gateway: write one row to a file, either {\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"idea_rejected_removed\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"pattern\":\"<rejected text>\",\"category\":\"<its category>\",\"timestamp\":\"<UTC now, e.g. 2026-05-24T00:00:00Z>\"} or {\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"idea_rejected_reset\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"reason\":\"<why>\",\"timestamp\":\"<UTC now>\"}, then run node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mode research --run-directory {artifact_dir} --event-json <that file> and rerun the reducer before resuming.'\n1265: \n1266:       step_ideas_backlog_lifecycle:\n1267:         action: \"Track reducer-owned observed/promoted/rejected idea lifecycle before dispatch\"\n1268:         read:\n1269:           - \"{state_paths.state_log}\"\n1270:           - \"{state_paths.registry}\"\n1271:           - \"{state_paths.config}\"\n1272:         lifecycle:\n1273:           observed_event: \"idea_observed\"\n1274:           promoted_event: \"idea_promoted\"\n1275:           rejected_event: \"idea_rejected\"\n1276:           min_observations: \"{min_idea_observations}\"\n1277:           authority: \"Leaf agents emit observations only; reducer emits promotions and owns ranking.\"\n1278:         validate:\n1279:           - \"If new leaf-authored output includes idea_promoted, fail validation; only reducer output may append idea_promoted.\"\n1280:           - \"If promoted_ideas_count > 0 and next_focus is empty or all questions are resolved, prefer the first unsuppressed promoted idea.\"\n1281:           - \"If suppressed_ideas_count > 0, do not render those ideas into dispatch context.\"\n1282:         outputs:\n1283:           - observed_ideas_count: \"Reducer-derived observed ideas count\"\n1284:           - promoted_ideas_count: \"Reducer-derived promoted ideas count after minIdeaObservations\"\n1285:           - suppressed_ideas_count: \"Reducer-derived rejected/suppressed ideas count\"\n1286:           - accepted_idea_candidate: \"First unsuppressed promoted idea, or null\"\n1287: \n1288:       step_normalize_pause_events:\n1289:         action: \"Normalize pause and recovery lifecycle events to the frozen STOP_REASONS enum at emission time\"\n1290:         stop_reasons_enum: [converged, maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused, maxDurationReached]\n1291:         rule_pause_sentinel:\n1292:           raw_event_forbidden: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"paused\"}'\n1293:           canonical_event: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"userPaused\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"run\":{current_iteration},\"stopReason\":\"userPaused\",\"sentinelPath\":\"{state_paths.pause_sentinel}\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\",\"sessionId\":\"{config.lineage.sessionId}\",\"generation\":{config.lineage.generation}}'\n1294:         rule_stuck_recovery:\n1295:           raw_event_forbidden: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"stuck_recovery\"}'\n1296:           canonical_event: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"stuckRecovery\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"run\":{current_iteration},\"stopReason\":\"stuckRecovery\",\"fromIteration\":{current_iteration},\"outcome\":\"recovered\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\",\"sessionId\":\"{config.lineage.sessionId}\",\"generation\":{config.lineage.generation}}'\n1297: \n1298:       step_marker_scan:\n1299:         action: \"H-2 loop-prevention guard: scan previous iteration's rendered prompt for nested research marker\"\n1300:         canonical_header: \"DEEP-RESEARCH\"\n1301:         nested_marker_pattern: \"^(DEEP-REVIEW|CODE-REVIEW)$\"\n1302:         algorithm: |\n1303:           if current_iteration > 1:\n1304:             PREV_PROMPT_PATH = \"{state_paths.prompt_dir}/iteration-{previous_iteration}.md\"\n1305:             if file_exists(PREV_PROMPT_PATH):\n1306:               PREV_PROMPT_FIRST_LINE = head -1 of PREV_PROMPT_PATH\n1307:               if PREV_PROMPT_FIRST_LINE matches nested_marker_pattern:\n1308:                 log \"ERROR: nested research-of-review loop detected (review marker found in previous iteration prompt). Aborting.\"\n1309:                 halt with exit code 2\n1310:         note: |\n1311:           False-positive prevention: a research prompt that starts with its own canonical\n1312:           header is this loop's own iteration output, never a nested dispatch; only a review\n1313:           marker is, so the guard matches nested_marker_pattern rather than the canonical\n1314:           header. Markers appearing in comments or body text are ignored. True-positive\n1315:           triggers only when a previous iteration's rendered prompt literally starts with a\n1316:           review marker, indicating a nested research-of-review dispatch.\n1317: \n1318:       # ─── APPROVAL GATE: Pre-Iteration ───\n1319:       gate_pre_iteration:\n1320:         applies_to: confirm\n1321:         skip_when: \"The operator already approved the next dispatch in this pass through gate_consecutive_failures, gate_divergent_pivot_choice or gate_divergent_pivot_override.\"\n1322:         type: approval_gate\n1323:         purpose: \"Show planned focus and get approval before dispatching agent\"\n1324:         present: |\n1325:           ## Iteration {current_iteration} of {max_iterations}\n1326: \n1327:           **Focus**: {next_focus}\n1328:           **Remaining Questions**: {remaining_questions}\n1329:           **Last newInfoRatio**: {last_newInfoRatio}\n1330:           **Stuck Count**: {stuck_count}\n1331: \n1332:           Options:\n1333:           A) Proceed with this focus\n1334:           B) Change focus to: [user provides new focus]\n1335:           C) Stop loop and synthesize now\n1336:           D) Cancel entirely\n1337:         wait_for: \"User response\"\n1338:         after_gate_refresh_lock: gate_defaults.after_gate_refresh_lock\n1339:         on_A: { proceed_to: step_dispatch_iteration }\n1340:         on_B: { action: \"Update next_focus to user's choice\", proceed_to: step_dispatch_iteration }\n1341:         on_C:\n1342:           action: \"Record the operator-requested manual stop before synthesis\"\n1343:           bookkeeping_log: '{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"manualStop\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"run\":{current_iteration},\"stopReason\":\"manualStop\",\"timestamp\":\"{ISO_8601_NOW}\",\"sessionId\":\"{config.lineage.sessionId}\",\"generation\":{config.lineage.generation}}'\n1344:           set: { reason: \"manualStop\" }\n1345:           proceed_to: gate_pre_synthesis\n1346:         on_D: { action: \"Cancel workflow\", status: \"CANCELLED\", release_lock: step_release_lock }\n1347: \n1348:       step_dispatch_iteration:\n1349:         action: \"Dispatch one iteration via the selected executor\"\n1350:         pre_dispatch_refresh_lock:\n1351:           action: \"Refresh the packet lock heartbeat immediately before the dispatch starts\"\n1352:           command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/loop-lock.cjs refresh --lock-path {state_paths.lock_file} --owner-pid {captured_owner_pid} --nonce {captured_acquire_nonce}\"\n1353:           on_refresh: \"If the refresh output has refreshed:false, fail closed: lost the packet lock. Run step_release_lock and stop rather than dispatch without it.\"\n1354:         post_dispatch_refresh_lock:\n1355:           action: \"Refresh the packet lock heartbeat immediately after the dispatch returns\"\n1356:           command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/loop-lock.cjs refresh --lock-path {state_paths.lock_file} --owner-pid {captured_owner_pid} --nonce {captured_acquire_nonce}\"\n1357:           on_refresh: \"If the refresh output has refreshed:false, fail closed: lost the packet lock. Run step_release_lock and stop rather than continue without it.\"\n1358:         dry_run_boundary: \"dispatch\"\n1359:         dry_run_preview:\n1360:           before_halt:\n1361:             - \"Generate the state summary.\"\n1362:             - \"Render the prompt pack to terminal preview without writing the prompt file.\"\n1363:             - \"Show the selected executor branch and command or native dispatch target that would run.\"\n1364:         resolve_executor:\n1365:           source: \"config.executor\"\n1366:           loader: \".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts#parseExecutorConfig\"\n1367:         pre_dispatch:\n1368:           generate_summary: |\n1369:             STATE SUMMARY (auto-generated):\n[Output truncated. Continue reading with offset: 1370]"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"limit\":250,\"offset\":1120,\"path\":\".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml\"}"},"time":{"start":1794801372139,"end":1794801372487}}}}
