ion: Phase 20: command-offer-fit-guards\n\n<!-- SPECKIT_LEVEL: 2 -->\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:metadata -->\n## 1. METADATA\n<!-- FILL: Fill every row: level, priority, status, date and branch. Use the real branch name. GOOD: Priority P1. Status Draft. Branch `feat/rotate-logs-keep`. WEAK: Priority TBD. Status maybe. -->\n\n| Field | Value |\n|-------|-------|\n| **Level** | 2 |\n| **Priority** | P1 |\n| **Status** | Complete |\n| **Created** | 2026-11-14 |\n| **Branch** | `worktrees/352-command-surfacing-research` |\n| **Parent Spec** | ../spec.md |\n| **Phase** | 20 of 23 |\n| **Predecessor** | 019-workflow-outcome-measure |\n| **Successor** | 021-brief-head-parity |\n| **Handoff Criteria** | Every task in `tasks.md` is `[x]`, the advisor suite reports 0 failed, every floor line equals its line in `scratch/before.txt`, `scratch/repro-after.txt` holds the after counts T014 names and strict validation prints `RESULT: PASSED` |\n<!-- /ANCHOR:metadata -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:phase-context -->\n## Phase Context\n\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/020-command-offer-fit-guards/:\nacceptance-criteria.md\ndescription.json\ngoal.md\ngraph-metadata.json\nimplementation-summary.md\nplan.md\nscratch\nspec.md\ntasks.md\n\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/021-brief-head-parity/:\nacceptance-criteria.md\ndescription.json\ngoal.md\ngraph-metadata.json\nimplementation-summary.md\nplan.md\nscratch\nspec.md\ntasks.md\n===\n---\ntitle: \"Feature Specification: Phase 20: command-offer-fit-guards\"\ndescription: \"The advisor hands a command to prompts where no command fits. A command the reader only refuses or asks about still arrives with a start policy, a typo fix gets a creation workflow, an app problem that shares doctor words gets a doctor command, a no-edit request gets a comman