e offer\",\"Treating the 033 offeredAs field as a record of model behaviour\"],\"focusTrack\":\"ux-offer-fit\",\"edgeCase\":\"none\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Bash\",\"Grep\",\"Glob\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:58\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:276\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:414\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:127\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:618\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/behaviour-fresh-prompts.jsonl:30\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/arm-evidence.txt:16\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/runs/dsh.jsonl:1\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/020-command-offer-fit-guards/implementation-summary.md:89\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/021-brief-head-parity/implementation-summary.md:51\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/research-segment-4.md:16\"],\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q-built-offer-split\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"What offer, ask and start decisions does the built brief make\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-policy-enum\",\"kind\":\"CLAIM\",\"label\":\"Policy enum run, start, ask carried per command row\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-prose-refusal-blind-spot\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"The mention reader only sees typed commands, so a prose refusal is not withheld\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"s-command-attach\",\"kind\":\"SOURCE\",\"label\":\"command-attach.ts\",\"path\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-f-policy-supports-q\",\"source\":\"f-policy-enum\",\"target\":\"q-built-offer-split\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-f-blind-spot-answers-q\",\"source\":\"f-prose-refusal-blind-spot\",\"target\":\"q-built-offer-split\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-f-blind-spot-cites-s\",\"source\":\"f-prose-refusal-blind-spot\",\"target\":\"s-command-attach\",\"relation\":\"CITES\"}]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-001\",\"label\":\"Offer policy is a three-word enum per command row: run executes, start opens a workflow, ask asks the person first; /deep:review and /deep:research are ask.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:58\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-002\",\"label\":\"The brief prints the policy word as a bare parenthetical with no legend, so nothing in the brief says what (ask) asks the model to do.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:618\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-003\",\"label\":\"Phase 020's mention reader only fires on a typed command string, so a prose refusal such as skip the deep review cannot reach the guard.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:414\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-004\",\"label\":\"command-attach.ts lists deep review as a depth-request phrase, so the prose words are read as a request for the heavy loop even inside a sentence that declines it.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:276\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-005\",\"label\":\"fresh-decline-refusal-02 asks to skip the deep review and only check typos and formatting, is typed decline/refusal, and expects no command.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/behaviour-fresh-prompts.jsonl:30\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-006\",\"label\":\"On that row both dsh arms still offered /deep:review at the head with policy ask, and the on arm delivered the brief, so the offer survived a prompt that refuses the workflow.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/runs/dsh.jsonl:1\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-007\",\"label\":\"The row carries the arm's only decline start: off 0 of 40, on 1 of 80, dsh on arm 1 of 16.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/arm-evidence.txt:16\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-008\",\"label\":\"Phase 020 cut reproduction-probe offers 26 to 8 but cost one real sealed row, real plain holdout 5 to 4 of 44; the 033 floor reads 5 of 44 at the arena commit.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/020-command-offer-fit-guards/implementation-summary.md:89\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/arm-evidence.txt:45\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-009\",\"label\":\"Phase 021 settled head parity, 17 of 17 probe prompts print the same head on Claude and OpenCode where 14 did before, so wording parity no longer explains a per-runtime difference.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/021-brief-head-parity/implementation-summary.md:51\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-010\",\"label\":\"Every brief carries a 219-byte comment-hygiene directive that says nothing about the command, about 72 percent of the pre-016 306-byte median brief, settled as not trimmed in segment one.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:127\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/research-segment-4.md:16\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Re-measuring routing floors in this lane\",\"reason\":\"The performance and routing lanes own typed recall, false offers and the sealed holdout; 033 already prints the floor lines.\",\"iteration\":1}\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-5/deltas/iter-001.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-5/deltas/iter-001.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-5/deltas/iter-001.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-ux-5-1794801313778-3ys69o\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-ux-5-1794801313778-3ys69o\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-ux-5-1794801313778-3ys69o\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"run\\\":1,\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Built-state map of the offer, ask and start split after phases 016 to 033\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":10,\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":0.6,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"Six of ten findings are new for this lane (the prose-refusal blind spot, the row-to-guard trace, the policy-word legend gap), four re-read established numbers from phases 020, 021 and segment four.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"Which offer, ask and start decisions does the built brief make today, and which of them phase 020's fit guard or phase 021's head parity already settled?\\\",\\\"Why did an ask offer of /deep:review reach the refusal decline row fresh-decline-refusal-02, and what does a declined or refused offer do on each runtime?\\\",\\\"What does the brief's wording cost a model that would otherwise start a workflow: head line, directive block, command-line order and length?\\\",\\\"Which offer-fit or decline-path UX gaps remain after phases 016 to 033 that no planned or built phase already covers?\\\"],\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"Which offer, ask and start decisions does the built brief make today, and which of them phase 020's fit guard or phase 021's head parity already settled?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"Re-measuring typed recall, false offers or the sealed holdout\\\",\\\"Reading holdout prompts to explain the offer\\\",\\\"Treating the 033 offeredAs field as a record of model behaviour\\\"],\\\"focusTrack\\\":\\\"ux-offer-fit\\\",\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Bash\\\",\\\"Grep\\\",\\\"Glob\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:58\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:276\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:414\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:127\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:618\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/behaviour-fresh-prompts.jsonl:30\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/arm-evidence.txt:16\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/runs/dsh.jsonl:1\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/020-command-offer-fit-guards/implementation-summary.md:89\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/021-brief-head-parity/implementation-summary.md:51\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/research-segment-4.md:16\\\"],\\\"graphEvents\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"q-built-offer-split\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"QUESTION\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"What offer, ask and start decisions does the built brief make\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-policy-enum\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"CLAIM\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Policy enum run, start, ask carried per command row\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-prose-refusal-blind-spot\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The mention reader only sees typed commands, so a prose refusal is not withheld\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"s-command-attach\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"SOURCE\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"command-attach.ts\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"e-f-policy-supports-q\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"f-policy-enum\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"q-built-offer-split\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"SUPPORTS\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"e-f-blind-spot-answers-q\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"f-prose-refusal-blind-spot\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"q-built-offer-split\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"ANSWERS\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"e-f-blind-spot-cites-s\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"f-prose-refusal-blind-spot\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"s-command-attach\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"CITES\\\"}]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter001-001\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Offer policy is a three-word enum per command row: run executes, start opens a workflow, ask asks the person first; /deep:review and /deep:research are ask.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:58\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter001-002\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The brief prints the policy word as a bare parenthetical with no legend, so nothing in the brief says what (ask) asks the model to do.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:618\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter001-003\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Phase 020's mention reader only fires on a typed command string, so a prose refusal such as skip the deep review cannot reach the guard.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:414\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter001-004\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"command-attach.ts lists deep review as a depth-request phrase, so the prose words are read as a request for the heavy loop even inside a sentence that declines it.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:276\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter001-005\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"fresh-decline-refusal-02 asks to skip the deep review and only check typos and formatting, is typed decline/refusal, and expects no command.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/behaviour-fresh-prompts.jsonl:30\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter001-006\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"On that row both dsh arms still offered /deep:review at the head with policy ask, and the on arm delivered the brief, so the offer survived a prompt that refuses the workflow.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/runs/dsh.jsonl:1\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter001-007\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The row carries the arm's only decline start: off 0 of 40, on 1 of 80, dsh on arm 1 of 16.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/arm-evidence.txt:16\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter001-008\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Phase 020 cut reproduction-probe offers 26 to 8 but cost one real sealed row, real plain holdout 5 to 4 of 44; the 033 floor reads 5 of 44 at the arena commit.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/020-command-offer-fit-guards/implementation-summary.md:89\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/arm-evidence.txt:45\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter001-009\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Phase 021 settled head parity, 17 of 17 probe prompts print the same head on Claude and OpenCode where 14 did before, so wording parity no longer explains a per-runtime difference.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/021-brief-head-parity/implementation-summary.md:51\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter001-010\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Every brief carries a 219-byte comment-hygiene directive that says nothing about the command, about 72 percent of the pre-016 306-byte median brief, settled as not trimmed in segment one.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:127\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/research-segment-4.md:16\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Re-measuring routing floors in this lane\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"The performance and routing lanes own typed recall, false offers and the sealed holdout; 033 already prints the floor lines.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1}\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-5/deltas/iter-001.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1794801701434,"end":1794801714927}}}}
