n pi, 3 on devin and 0 on Claude, and only one run marks the command declined.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/summary-arm.json:1\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-008\",\"label\":\"dsh on arm records five runs with no tracked workflow and all five acted, so model action is not mediated by the brief on every row.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/summary-arm.json:1\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Treating an offer on a decline row as a safety failure by itself\",\"reason\":\"Forty-nine of fifty decline-row offers produced no start; the failure needs both the offer and the model action.\",\"iteration\":2}\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-5/deltas/iter-002.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-5/deltas/iter-002.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-5/deltas/iter-002.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-ux-5-1794801313778-3ys69o\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-ux-5-1794801313778-3ys69o\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-ux-5-1794801313778-3ys69o\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"run\\\":2,\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"The decline taxonomy, and what a declined or refused offer does\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":8,\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":0.75,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"Six of eight findings are new measurements for this lane (5 of 8 decline offers, the gate order that lets the refusal row through, the substitution start); two restate the taxonomy and phase 020's limitation.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"Why did an ask offer of /deep:review reach the refusal decline row fresh-decline-refusal-02, and what does a declined or refused offer do on each runtime?\\\",\\\"What does the brief's wording cost a model that would otherwise start a workflow: head line, directive block, command-line order and length?\\\",\\\"Which offer-fit or decline-path UX gaps remain after phases 016 to 033 that no planned or built phase already covers?\\\"],\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"Why did an ask offer of /deep:review reach the refusal decline row fresh-decline-refusal-02, and what does a declined or refused offer do on each runtime?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"Counting startedOfOffered as a decline-row rate\\\",\\\"Treating an offer on a decline row as a safety failure by itself\\\",\\\"Re-checking phase 020's question-shape limitation as new evidence\\\"],\\\"focusTrack\\\":\\\"ux-decline-safety\\\",\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Bash\\\",\\\"Grep\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/behaviour-fresh-prompts.jsonl:28\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:339\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:494\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:510\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/runs/dsh.jsonl:1\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/rout