 on all five runtimes and both arms: create goal, ai council, create readme, deep review and create changelog.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/runs/dsh.jsonl:1\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-003\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Four of the five offers are prose mentions invisible to the typed-command guard, which only tests the literal command string.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:494\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-004\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The refusal row passes every attach gate: not a no-edit request, no typed command, not one of the three gated creation commands, and deep review satisfies the depth-request list.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:510\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-005\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The create-changelog offer is a named exclusion, because the small-edit gate covers only readme, feature catalog and manual testing playbook.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:339\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-006\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The arm's only decline start is dsh on arm run 1 on the refusal row, and it started create-sk-skill while deep-review was offered, so it is a substitution.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/summary-arm.json:1\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-007\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Explicit declines are near-absent: offer echoes run 7 on dsh, 2 on OpenCode, 2 on pi, 3 on devin and 0 on Claude, and only one run marks the command declined.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/summary-arm.json:1\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-008\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"dsh on arm records five runs with no tracked workflow and all five acted, so model action is not mediated by the brief on every row.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/summary-arm.json:1\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Treating an offer on a decline row as a safety failure by itself\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Forty-nine of fifty decline-row offers produced no start; the failure needs both the offer and the model action.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2}\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-5/deltas/iter-002.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1794801888199,"end":1794801898948}}}}
