{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794802033419,"sessionID":"ses_e1d814441ffe6QmxiENmg3wjTp","part":{"partID":"prt_1e2897c96001zouKbY62X6YjMh","sessionID":"ses_e1d814441ffe6QmxiENmg3wjTp","messageID":"msg_1e2897386001piC7zzqXjmkyMi","type":"tool","id":"call_b966355f59024317a4df4cd3","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":3,\"runId\":\"fanout-ux-5-1794801313778-3ys69o\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-ux-5-1794801313778-3ys69o\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-ux-5-1794801313778-3ys69o\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"run\":3,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"What the brief's wording costs, measured against what models did\",\"findingsCount\":8,\"newInfoRatio\":0.7,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Six of eight findings are new measurements or disconfirmations for this lane (the 218-byte fixed tail share, per-policy start spread at identical bytes, Claude 0 of 10); two restate settled ground.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"What does the brief's wording cost a model that would otherwise start a workflow: head line, directive block, command-line order and length?\",\"Which offer-fit or decline-path UX gaps remain after phases 016 to 033 that no planned or built phase already covers?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"What does the brief's wording cost a model that would otherwise start a workflow: head line, directive block, command-line order and length?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Truncation as a wording defect\",\"Head parity as a per-runtime explanation\",\"Cutting the scores and pass mark\"],\"focusTrack\":\"ux-brief-wording\",\"edgeCase\":\"none\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Bash\",\"Grep\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:104\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:127\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:133\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:618\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/residual-limits-4/scratch/live-brief-ts.json:1\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/015-health-default-and-brief-refinements/scratch/live-heads.txt:1\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/summary-arm.json:1\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/arm-evidence.txt:1\"],\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-fixed-tail-share\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"A 218-byte comments directive is 71 percent of the median brief\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-policy-spread\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Identical brief bytes but 0 of 10 to 7 of 10 start-policy starts\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-spread-contradicts-wording\",\"source\":\"f-policy-spread\",\"target\":\"q-brief-wording\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q-brief-wording\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"What does the brief wording cost a model that would start a workflow\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-tail-supports-spread\",\"source\":\"f-fixed-tail-share\",\"target\":\"f-policy-spread\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"}]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-001\",\"label\":\"Every brief ends with a fixed 218-byte tail, a 12-byte label plus a 206-byte comment-hygiene directive, which is 71 percent of the 306-byte median live brief.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:127\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-002\",\"label\":\"The command line is about 13 percent of a median brief: a 39-byte label for system-deep-loop to deep-review plus about 15 bytes of scores and pass.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:618\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-003\",\"label\":\"The policy word is printed but never defined; the brief has no legend for run, start or ask, and the only explanatory block is the hygiene directive.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:133\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-004\",\"label\":\"At identical brief bytes the on-arm start-policy starts are Claude 0 of 10, OpenCode 5 of 10, pi 4 of 10, devin 5 of 10 and dsh 7 of 10, so wording cannot cause the spread.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/summary-arm.json:1\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-005\",\"label\":\"Claude started none of its ten start-policy rows in either arm and capped none, so the advisor-on gain came from run or ask rows.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/arm-evidence.txt:1\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/summary-arm.json:1\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-006\",\"label\":\"The ask word does not reliably produce an ask: on the five ask-policy rows the on arm started 1 on Claude, 0 on OpenCode, 0 on pi, 2 on devin and 3 on dsh.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/summary-arm.json:1\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-007\",\"label\":\"The head is not truncated in practice: an 80-token cap is about 320 characters against an 88-byte median head, so the command and policy always fit.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:104\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-008\",\"label\":\"Inference: a brief whose last sentence is an unrelated HARD BLOCK about code comments spends the reader's final attention on a rule that cannot help it act on the command; an A/B with the tail moved or removed would confirm it.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:127\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/summary-arm.json:1\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Truncation as a wording defect\",\"reason\":\"The 80-token cap is far above the 88-byte measured head, so the command and policy always fit.\",\"iteration\":3}\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-5/deltas/iter-003.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-5/deltas/iter-003.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-5/deltas/iter-003.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-ux-5-1794801313778-3ys69o\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-ux-5-1794801313778-3ys69o\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-ux-5-1794801313778-3ys69o\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"run\\\":3,\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"What the brief's wording costs, measured against what models did\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":8,\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":0.7,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"Six of eight findings are new measurements or disconfirmations for this lane (the 218-byte fixed tail share, per-policy start spread at identical bytes, Claude 0 of 10); two restate settled ground.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"What does the brief's wording cost a model that would otherwise start a workflow: head line, directive block, command-line order and length?\\\",\\\"Which offer-fit or decline-path UX gaps remain after phases 016 to 033 that no planned or built phase already covers?\\\"],\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"What does the brief's wording cost a model that would otherwise start a workflow: head line, directive block, command-line order and length?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"Truncation as a wording defect\\\",\\\"Head parity as a per-runtime explanation\\\",\\\"Cutting the scores and pass mark\\\"],\\\"focusTrack\\\":\\\"ux-brief-wording\\\",\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Bash\\\",\\\"Grep\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:104\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:127\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:133\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:618\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/residual-limits-4/scratch/live-brief-ts.json:1\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/015-health-default-and-brief-refinements/scratch/live-heads.txt:1\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/summary-arm.json:1\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/arm-evidence.txt:1\\\"],\\\"graphEvents\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-fixed-tail-share\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"A 218-byte comments directive is 71 percent of the median brief\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-policy-spread\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Identical brief bytes but 0 of 10 to 7 of 10 start-policy starts\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"e-spread-contradicts-wording\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"f-policy-spread\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"q-brief-wording\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"ANSWERS\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"q-brief-wording\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"QUESTION\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"What does the brief wording cost a model that would start a workflow\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"e-tail-supports-spread\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"f-fixed-tail-share\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"f-policy-spread\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"SUPPORTS\\\"}]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-001\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Every brief ends with a fixed 218-byte tail, a 12-byte label plus a 206-byte comment-hygiene directive, which is 71 percent of the 306-byte median live brief.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:127\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-002\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The command line is about 13 percent of a median brief: a 39-byte label for system-deep-loop to deep-review plus about 15 bytes of scores and pass.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:618\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-003\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The policy word is printed but never defined; the brief has no legend for run, start or ask, and the only explanatory block is the hygiene directive.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:133\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-004\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"At identical brief bytes the on-arm start-policy starts are Claude 0 of 10, OpenCode 5 of 10, pi 4 of 10, devin 5 of 10 and dsh 7 of 10, so wording cannot cause the spread.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/summary-arm.json:1\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-005\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Claude started none of its ten start-policy rows in either arm and capped none, so the advisor-on gain came from run or ask rows.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/arm-evidence.txt:1\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/summary-arm.json:1\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-006\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The ask word does not reliably produce an ask: on the five ask-policy rows the on arm started 1 on Claude, 0 on OpenCode, 0 on pi, 2 on devin and 3 on dsh.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/summary-arm.json:1\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-007\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The head is not truncated in practice: an 80-token cap is about 320 characters against an 88-byte median head, so the command and policy always fit.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:104\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-008\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Inference: a brief whose last sentence is an unrelated HARD BLOCK about code comments spends the reader's final attention on a rule that cannot help it act on the command; an A/B with the tail moved or removed would confirm it.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:127\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/summary-arm.json:1\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Truncation as a wording defect\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"The 80-token cap is far above the 88-byte measured head, so the command and policy always fit.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3}\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-5/deltas/iter-003.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1794802023574,"end":1794802033419}}}}
