{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794802286182,"sessionID":"ses_e1d814441ffe6QmxiENmg3wjTp","part":{"partID":"prt_1e28d601e001G5KedpSZ1KclVS","sessionID":"ses_e1d814441ffe6QmxiENmg3wjTp","messageID":"msg_1e28d53d8001Gl1IKuy2T2EGG7","type":"tool","id":"call_7c35563988be48c8a6e401e4","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":5,\"runId\":\"fanout-ux-5-1794801313778-3ys69o\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-ux-5-1794801313778-3ys69o\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-ux-5-1794801313778-3ys69o\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"run\":5,\"status\":\"insight\",\"focus\":\"Verification pass, two corrections and one withdrawal\",\"findingsCount\":7,\"newInfoRatio\":0.4,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Three of seven findings are corrections of this lane's own claims (the root-doc legend, R2's wrong mechanism, the existing test), which is new information about the recommendations rather than new external evidence.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"Why did an ask offer of `/deep:review` reach the refusal decline row fresh-decline-refusal-02, and what does a declined or refused offer do on each runtime?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Why did an ask offer of `/deep:review` reach the refusal decline row fresh-decline-refusal-02, and what does a declined or refused offer do on each runtime?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"A brief legend for the policy words\",\"Gating create-changelog by command name for the release-date row\"],\"focusTrack\":\"ux-verification\",\"edgeCase\":\"contradictory-evidence\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Bash\",\"Grep\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"AGENTS.md:68\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:294\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts:312\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/behaviour-fresh-prompts.jsonl:16\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-5/deep-research-strategy.md:38\"],\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-root-doc-legend\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"The policy legend lives in AGENTS.md, not the brief\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-r2-correction\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"The small-edit gate needs the date wording, not the changelog command\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-legend-supersedes\",\"source\":\"f-root-doc-legend\",\"target\":\"f-policy-spread\",\"relation\":\"SUPERSEDES\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-r2-supersedes\",\"source\":\"f-r2-correction\",\"target\":\"f-gap-r1-prose\",\"relation\":\"SUPERSEDES\"}]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-001\",\"label\":\"The policy vocabulary is defined once in AGENTS.md, run starts now, start starts without auto, ask offers it in one question and waits, and all five arenas load that file.\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"AGENTS.md:68\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-002\",\"label\":\"R3 is withdrawn: a brief legend would duplicate the root doc every measured runtime reads and would spend bytes on a 306-byte payload.\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"AGENTS.md:68\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-003\",\"label\":\"R2's mechanism is wrong: the release-date row carries no listed small-edit phrase, so gating create-changelog by command name would still leave the offer.\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:294\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-004\",\"label\":\"The smallest correct change for the release-date row is a single-value edit phrase such as release date or version number; the fresh changelog request keeps its command because it carries a creation verb and no correction verb.\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/behaviour-fresh-prompts.jsonl:16\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-005\",\"label\":\"The existing guard test keeps add a changelog entry for the typo fixes via the creation-request stand-down, so any new phrase must preserve that case.\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts:312\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-006\",\"label\":\"R5 is confirmed by the root doc: AGENTS.md already says take either path whole and never an improvised one, so the dsh substitution breaks an existing instruction and the gap is compliance.\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"AGENTS.md:68\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-007\",\"label\":\"The carry-over question's exact text carries backticks around deep-review; iteration 2 recorded a paraphrase, so this iteration records the exact text and the same answer.\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-5/deep-research-strategy.md:38\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"A brief legend for the policy words\",\"reason\":\"AGENTS.md defines the vocabulary for every measured runtime.\",\"iteration\":5}\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-5/deltas/iter-005.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-5/deltas/iter-005.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-5/deltas/iter-005.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false