{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794802613321,"sessionID":"ses_e1d814441ffe6QmxiENmg3wjTp","part":{"partID":"prt_1e29277c4001lU6PDs0teGBama","sessionID":"ses_e1d814441ffe6QmxiENmg3wjTp","messageID":"msg_1e292702c001WO1WxzkQNwRPQW","type":"tool","id":"call_8d64e607475f48e596d08a85","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"[SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:2314]","oldString":"[SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:2199]","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-5/iterations/iteration-006.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-5/iterations/iteration-006.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-5/iterations/iteration-006.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-5/iterations/iteration-006.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-5/iterations/iteration-006.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-5/iterations/iteration-006.md\n@@ -18,9 +18,9 @@\n 2. Five of the seven offers are the row's expected command (`/create:readme`, `/create:goal`, `/design:chart`, `/design:diagram`, and `/doctor:agents-md check` for the `/doctor:agents-md` family). Two are a different doctor command: `/doctor:setup` where the row wants `/doctor:env`, and `/doctor:overlay status` where it wants `/doctor:update`. [SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/behaviour-fresh-prompts.jsonl:11]\n 3. None of the five ask-policy plain rows carries a command: the changelog row, the deep-research row, the deep-review row, the design-extract row and the skill-advisor doctor row all reach the model as a skill with no runnable command. [SOURCE: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/runs/claude.jsonl:1]\n 4. The depth gate is inverted on the only two fresh rows that use a depth phrase. `fresh-fit-18` asks for \"a thorough multi-pass review\" and expects `/deep:review`; `fresh-decline-refusal-02` says \"skip the deep review\" and expects nothing. The brief offers `/deep:review` on the refusal and not on the request, on all five runtimes. [SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/behaviour-fresh-prompts.jsonl:18]\n 5. R1 must therefore be two-sided. A prose depth-phrase rule that only reads refusals would remove the false offer on the refusal row and leave the missing offer on the real request; the same change must prove both rows. Confirmation: one render replay shows `/deep:review` in `fresh-fit-18`'s head and not in the refusal row's head. [INFERENCE: from findings 4 and the attach gate at command-attach.ts:510]\n-6. The 13 no-command rows are not all failures: a skill-only route is counted as followed by the arm's own metric, so 7 of 20 is an offer-surface count, not a success rate. What it does bound is the reach of the policy word: a model cannot act on a `(start)` or `(ask)` word the brief never printed. [SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:2199]\n+6. The 13 no-command rows are not all failures: a skill-only route is counted as followed by the arm's own metric, so 7 of 20 is an offer-surface count, not a success rate. What it does bound is the reach of the policy word: a model cannot act on a `(start)` or `(ask)` word the brief never printed. [SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:2314]\n \n ## Ruled Out\n \n - Treating 13 of 20 as 13 failures: the arm's metric follows a skill path, so the count is about the offer surface only.\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-5/iterations/iteration-006.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"[SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:2314]\",\"oldString\":\"[SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:2199]\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux-5/iterations/iteration-006.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794802612164,"end":1794802613321}}}}
