{"type":"text","timestamp":1794803003324,"sessionID":"ses_e1d814441ffe6QmxiENmg3wjTp","part":{"id":"prt_1e2985c8a001ssirGEQZ7vKHdE","sessionID":"ses_e1d814441ffe6QmxiENmg3wjTp","messageID":"msg_1e297eed8001GOtG9A7KYVpw6d","type":"text","text":"## Iteration 7 complete (lineage converged)\n\n**Focus**: UX lane (ux-5) on the built state after phases 016–033 at `HEAD 84de3d600fa` — offer fit, decline/refusal safety, brief wording.\n**Findings**: 53 registered across 7 iterations (newInfoRatio 0.60 → 0.85 → 0.20).\n**Questions answered**: 4 of 4. **Questions remaining**: 0.\n**Stop reason**: `converged` (score 0.743; question coverage 0.75, claim verification 0.833, source diversity 2, evidence depth 2, contradictions 0).\n\n**Headline results**\n- The on-arm brief carries a command on **7 of 20 fresh plain rows**, identically on all five runtimes; **0 of 5 ask-policy rows** carry one.\n- **5 of 8 fresh decline rows** still receive a command. Four are prose mentions the typed-command guard cannot see (`command-attach.ts:414`); the fifth is the named small-edit exclusion (`:339`).\n- The depth gate is **inverted**: `/deep:review` is offered on \"skip the deep review\" but not on the only real \"thorough multi-pass review\" row.\n- The arm's single decline start was a **substitution** — dsh began `/create:sk-skill` while `/deep:review` was offered.\n- The brief is **71% fixed comment-hygiene tail** (218 of 306 median bytes); at identical bytes start-policy starts range **Claude 0/10 to dsh 7/10**.\n- Recommendations R1 (two-sided prose depth gate), R2 (single-value edit phrase, corrected), R4 (measure Claude's start-policy silence), R5 (split the decline target) stand; **R3 withdrawn** — `AGENTS.md:68` already defines the policy vocabulary.\n\n**Files written** (all inside the lineage):\n`research.md`, `deep-research-strategy.md`, `deep-research-dashboard.md`, `findings-registry.json`, `resource-map.md`, `deep-research-config.json` (status complete), `deep-research-state.jsonl` (gateway-projected), 7 × `iterations/iteration-00N.md`, 7 × `deltas/iter-00N.jsonl`.\n\n**Verification**\n- `verify-iteration.cjs` OK for iterations 1–7; every iteration recorded through `append-mode-event.cjs` (ledger sequences 2–9).\n- Reducer run after every iteration and at synthesis; `iterationsCompleted=7`, `corruptionCount=0`.\n- Lock released; `git status` shows no change outside `…/research/` (only the pre-existing fan-out files plus this lineage).\n- Scope note: one throwaway id list (`/tmp/plain-ids.txt`) was written to the OS temp dir during iteration 6; no repository path outside the lineage was touched.\n\nFANOUT_LINEAGE_COMPLETE:ux-5","time":{"start":1794802998410,"end":1794803003324}}}
